{
  "$schema": "../data/component-spec-schema.json",
  "component": "alert-dialog",
  "version": "2.0.0",
  "status": "stable",
  "layer": "organism",
  "tags": [
    "overlay",
    "interactive",
    "dialog",
    "confirmation"
  ],
  "anatomy": {
    "rootElement": ".nc-alert-dialog",
    "slots": [
      {
        "name": "icon",
        "selector": ".nc-alert-dialog__icon",
        "required": false,
        "description": null
      },
      {
        "name": "header",
        "selector": ".nc-alert-dialog__header",
        "required": true,
        "description": null
      },
      {
        "name": "title",
        "selector": ".nc-alert-dialog__title",
        "required": true,
        "description": null
      },
      {
        "name": "description",
        "selector": ".nc-alert-dialog__description",
        "required": false,
        "description": null
      },
      {
        "name": "footer",
        "selector": ".nc-alert-dialog__footer",
        "required": true,
        "description": null
      }
    ],
    "notes": [
      "Root: natives <dialog> Element. showModal() fuer modale Anzeige.",
      "Verwendet --nc-dialog-* Tokens (geteilt mit Modal und Drawer).",
      "Icon-Slot (v2.0): Optionales Status-Icon vor dem Header. Bei destructive: rotes Warnsymbol (nc-dialog-danger-icon-color). Verstaerkt visuelle Dringlichkeit.",
      "Header: flex-column, Title + Description. Gap via header-gap.",
      "Footer: flex, justify-end, Cancel + Action Buttons.",
      "[open]: display:flex. Zentriert via fixed + margin:auto.",
      "Backdrop: ::backdrop mit overlay-bg Fade-in Animation.",
      "Body Scroll Lock: body:has(.nc-alert-dialog[open]) { overflow: hidden }.",
      "Destructive-Modifier: .nc-alert-dialog--destructive setzt Icon-Farbe auf danger und styled Action-Button als Danger-Button.",
      "Focus-Management: Bei default: autofocus auf Action-Button (primaere Aktion). Bei destructive: autofocus auf Cancel-Button (verhindert versehentliches Loeschen = Anti-Slipping-Pattern).",
      "Visuelle Synergie: Danger-Farben (bg, border, icon-color) sind identisch mit .nc-alert--danger, sodass ein Danger-Alert im Formular visuell exakt zum darauf folgenden Destructive-Alert-Dialog passt."
    ]
  },
  "api": null,
  "variants": {
    "intent": {
      "label": "Intent",
      "description": "Intention — default (neutral, informativ), destructive (Loeschen/Gefahr, visuell hervorgehoben)",
      "values": [
        {
          "value": "default",
          "cssModifier": null,
          "default": false,
          "label": "default"
        },
        {
          "value": "destructive",
          "cssModifier": "nc-alert-dialog--destructive",
          "default": false,
          "label": "destructive"
        }
      ]
    },
    "content": {
      "label": "Content",
      "description": "Inhalt — with-description (Title + Description), title-only (nur Title), with-icon (Title + Description + Status-Icon)",
      "values": [
        {
          "value": "with-description",
          "cssModifier": null,
          "default": false,
          "label": "with-description"
        },
        {
          "value": "title-only",
          "cssModifier": null,
          "default": false,
          "label": "title-only"
        },
        {
          "value": "with-icon",
          "cssModifier": null,
          "default": false,
          "label": "with-icon"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "states": {
    "supported": [
      "default",
      "open"
    ],
    "interactive": true,
    "rules": [
      {
        "state": "open",
        "effects": [],
        "attributes": {},
        "description": null
      }
    ]
  },
  "cssApi": {
    "baseClasses": [
      "nc-alert-dialog"
    ],
    "tokenGroups": {
      "Container": [
        {
          "token": "--nc-dialog-max-width"
        },
        {
          "token": "--nc-dialog-padding"
        },
        {
          "token": "--nc-dialog-radius"
        },
        {
          "token": "--nc-dialog-bg"
        },
        {
          "token": "--nc-dialog-shadow"
        },
        {
          "token": "--nc-dialog-overlay-bg"
        },
        {
          "token": "--nc-dialog-section-gap"
        }
      ],
      "Header": [
        {
          "token": "--nc-dialog-title-font-size"
        },
        {
          "token": "--nc-dialog-title-font-weight"
        },
        {
          "token": "--nc-dialog-title-color"
        },
        {
          "token": "--nc-dialog-header-gap"
        }
      ],
      "Footer & Description": [
        {
          "token": "--nc-dialog-description-font-size"
        },
        {
          "token": "--nc-dialog-description-color"
        },
        {
          "token": "--nc-dialog-footer-gap"
        }
      ],
      "Status Icon": [
        {
          "token": "--nc-dialog-icon-size"
        }
      ],
      "Destructive Intent": [
        {
          "token": "--nc-dialog-danger-icon-color"
        },
        {
          "token": "--nc-dialog-danger-action-bg"
        },
        {
          "token": "--nc-dialog-danger-action-color"
        }
      ]
    },
    "modTokens": [
      "--mod-dialog-max-width",
      "--mod-dialog-padding",
      "--mod-dialog-radius",
      "--mod-dialog-bg",
      "--mod-dialog-shadow",
      "--mod-dialog-overlay-bg",
      "--mod-dialog-section-gap",
      "--mod-dialog-title-font-size",
      "--mod-dialog-title-font-weight",
      "--mod-dialog-title-color",
      "--mod-dialog-header-gap",
      "--mod-dialog-description-font-size",
      "--mod-dialog-description-color",
      "--mod-dialog-footer-gap",
      "--mod-dialog-icon-size",
      "--mod-dialog-danger-icon-color",
      "--mod-dialog-danger-action-bg",
      "--mod-dialog-danger-action-color"
    ]
  },
  "keyboard": null,
  "testSelectors": null,
  "events": null,
  "a11y": {
    "role": null,
    "interactive": true,
    "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
    "focusIndicator": null,
    "assertions": [
      "hasAccessibleName",
      "supportsKeyboard",
      "focusTrap"
    ],
    "overrides": [
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "intent": [
              "default"
            ]
          }
        },
        "require": [],
        "suggest": [
          "autofocus-action"
        ],
        "note": "Default: autofocus auf Action-Button (primaere Aktion) fuer direkten Keyboard-Zugriff."
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "intent": [
              "destructive"
            ]
          }
        },
        "require": [
          "autofocus-cancel"
        ],
        "suggest": [],
        "note": "Destructive: autofocus auf Cancel-Button statt Action — verhindert Slipping-Fehler (versehentliches Loeschen bei schnellem Enter). Best-Practice fuer destruktive Aktionen."
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "content": [
              "with-icon"
            ]
          }
        },
        "require": [
          "aria-hidden-icon"
        ],
        "suggest": [],
        "note": "Status-Icon ist dekorativ (aria-hidden='true'). Semantik kommt aus dem Titel und der Beschreibung."
      }
    ]
  },
  "dependencies": [
    "alert"
  ],
  "pipeline": {
    "scss": [
      "scss/scss/07-organisms/_alert-dialog.scss"
    ],
    "story": "stories/organisms/alert-dialog.stories.js",
    "arena": "apps/theme-configurator/src/components/laboratory/RecipeArena.vue",
    "drupal": [],
    "docs": "docs/alert-dialog-docs.html"
  }
}
